---
layout: layouts/base.njk
---
{#
  layouts/lanyard.njk
  -------------------
  The lanyard About page.

    - A hanging card you can drag and throw sits behind everything, covering
      the whole window so it is never cut off.
    - Left: the bio, which reveals itself word by word as you scroll, with
      Education and Publications fading in underneath it.
    - Right: your skills as a wheel that turns as you scroll the page. On a
      phone it is a plain list instead.

  Where things come from:
    - Text and photo: the real About page (src/about.md), edited from
      /admin -> Pages -> About. Nothing is duplicated.
    - The card, wheel and scroll effects: assets/js/lanyard.bundle.js reads
      the data-* settings below. Change them here to restyle.

  Card settings (data-lanyard):
        data-front        photo on the front of the card
        data-back         image on the back (click or throw the card to flip it).
                          To use your own, replace src/assets/img/lanyard/card-back.png
                          with a picture in the card's proportions (about 1024 x 1440)
        data-back-fit     "cover" (fills the card) or "contain" (whole image shown)
        data-strap        image printed along the strap
        data-card-color   card colour behind the photo
        data-fit          "cover" (fills the card) or "contain" (whole photo)
        data-finish       glossy | matte | holographic | metallic
        data-size         card size (0.6 is the default)
        data-strap-length how far the card hangs (0 to 1)
        data-gravity, data-damping, data-elasticity, data-breeze
                          how heavy, swingy and windy it feels (0 to 1)

  Wheel settings (data-wheel):
        data-font-size    text size in rem          data-inset  distance from the edge, px
        data-curve        how far the curve bends   data-fade   how quickly names fade out
        data-blur         how blurry far names get  data-active-color / data-text-color
#}
{% set data = aboutPage.data %}

<h1 class="visually-hidden">{{ title }}</h1>

<div class="lany">

  {# The card: a fixed layer over the whole window, behind the text. #}
  <div class="lany__stage"
       data-lanyard
       {% if data.photo %}data-front="{{ data.photo | url }}"{% endif %}
       data-back="{{ '/assets/img/lanyard/card-back.png' | url }}"
       data-back-fit="cover"
       data-strap="{{ '/assets/img/lanyard/strap.png' | url }}"
       data-card-color="#ffffff"
       data-fit="cover"
       data-finish="glossy"
       data-size="0.55"
       data-strap-length="0.5"
       aria-label="A hanging name card. Drag it to swing it."></div>

  <section class="lany__text">
    <div class="lany__bio" data-reveal>
      {{ aboutPage.html | safe }}
    </div>

    {% if data.education and data.education.length %}
    <div class="lany__block">
      <h2>Education</h2>
      <ul class="lany__list">
        {% for item in data.education %}
        <li>{{ item.school }} | {{ item.degree }}</li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ul>
    </div>
    {% endif %}

    {% if data.publications and data.publications.length %}
    <div class="lany__block">
      <h2>Publications</h2>
      <ul class="lany__list">
        {% for item in data.publications %}
        <li>
          {{ item.title }}
          {% if item.url %}<a class="lany__link" href="{{ item.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ item.url }}</a>{% endif %}
        </li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ul>
    </div>
    {% endif %}
  </section>

  {% if data.skills and data.skills.length %}
  <aside class="lany__skills">
    <h2 class="lany__skills-title">Skills</h2>
    {# The plain list: shown on phones and read by screen readers. On a wide
       screen the wheel below takes its place and turns as you scroll. #}
    <ul class="lany__list lany__list--tight lany__skills-list">
      {% for skill in data.skills %}
      <li>{{ skill.skill if skill.skill else skill }}</li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
    <div class="lany__wheel" data-wheel
         data-side="right" data-font-size="2" data-inset="40"
         data-curve="0.5" data-fade="0.28" data-blur="2.25"
         data-loop="true" data-active-color="#000000" data-text-color="#515151"></div>
  </aside>
  {% endif %}

</div>
